      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "然而那得要有知識才行！<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n在這世上，我不知道的事情\n還有很多很多！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǜ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 636,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7136800C90A35F978981670977E58B58624D884CFF0100100001BE01000A572890194E164E0AFF0C62114E0D77E5905376844E8B60C5000A908467095F88591A5F88591AFF0100100002011401DC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "於是我想請教好像\n對有的沒的都很懂的<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳！<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n希望取得有用的資訊\n來架設新的告示板！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǜ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
