      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8B1D8B1DFF01591A86674E8600100003110000FF01014F6059B3FF0C000A621160F3900F904E544A793A677F50B3905476844E8B60C58B8A621000334EF64E86300200100002011401DC0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那麼，最後一個問題。\n<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳的話，會想要哪個內容的告示板呢？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǜ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 44,
